{"meta":{"ui":"dashboard","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"a2ui","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show me how the product did this month as an inline dashboard: four stat tiles (revenue, sign-ups, churn, active users) each with its change, a line chart of revenue, a bar chart of sign-ups by channel, a toggle between 7, 30 and 90 days that changes the numbers, and a table of the top five plans I can sort by any column.","text":"I can't produce that dashboard with the components this catalog provides: there is no line chart, bar chart, or table component in the basic catalog. Also, the metrics you've asked for (revenue, sign-ups, churn, active users, plan data) aren't in my context, so any numbers I wrote would be invented. I'd rather not fabricate product figures.\n\nWhat I can build now, using only catalog components, is a 390-wide card with the four stat tiles, a 7/30/90-day toggle, and placeholder values you can replace with real data. Charts and sortable tables would need a catalog that includes them, or you could supply the data and I'd render it as text lists.\n\nHere is that version:\n\n{\"version\":\"1.0\",\"createSurface\":{\"surfaceId\":\"dashboard\",\"catalogId\":\"https://a2ui.org/specification/v1_0/catalogs/basic/catalog.json\",\"components\":[{\"id\":\"root\",\"component\":\"Card\",\"child\":\"layout\"},{\"id\":\"layout\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"title\",\"range\",\"tiles\"]},{\"id\":\"title\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\":\"This month\",\"variant\":\"body\",\"weight\":1},{\"id\":\"range\",\"component\":\"ChoicePicker\",\"label\":\"Period\",\"variant\":\"mutuallyExclusive\",\"displayStyle\":\"chips\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"7 days\",\"value\":\"7\"},{\"label\":\"30 days\",\"value\":\"30\"},{\"label\":\"90 days\",\"value\":\"90\"}],\"value\":{\"@path\":\"/range\"}},{\"id\":\"tiles\",\"component\":\"Column\",\"children\":[\"revenueTile\",\"signupsTile\",\"churnTile\",\"activeTile\"]},{\"id\":\"revenueTile\",\"component\":\"Text\",\"text\"